1
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:20,789
The morning freeze is biting through my skin

2
00:00:21,690 --> 00:00:26,269
I rode an hour just to find you in

3
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:35,320
The old oak trees stand naked in the gray

4
00:00:35,969 --> 00:00:40,409
And all my fevered prayers are swept away

5
00:00:42,990 --> 00:00:49,070
My heart stops dead before this silent lawn

6
00:00:50,060 --> 00:00:55,829
A printed board that says that you are gone

7
00:00:57,310 --> 00:01:03,189
The garden sleeps in rot where hope must fail

8
00:01:04,370 --> 00:01:13,090
A hollow sign that screams: House for Sale

9
00:01:18,599 --> 00:01:25,030
The windows stare like vacant, blindfolded eyes

10
00:01:25,780 --> 00:01:30,780
No curtain shifts to answer all my cries

11
00:01:32,799 --> 00:01:37,890
I leave my bike, I stumble on the stone

12
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:44,870
I never felt so utterly alone

13
00:01:47,090 --> 00:01:52,750
I hammer on the oak with bleeding hands

14
00:01:54,099 --> 00:01:59,140
No mother answers, no one understands

15
00:02:01,260 --> 00:02:06,939
The empty hallway mocks my ragged wail

16
00:02:08,110 --> 00:02:17,039
A monument of grief: House for Sale

17
00:02:28,479 --> 00:02:34,520
I press my fevered forehead to the wood

18
00:02:36,469 --> 00:02:42,330
And realize the things I misunderstood

19
00:02:42,479 --> 00:02:49,259
My trembling knees collapse upon the street

20
00:02:50,680 --> 00:02:57,830
As blackness pulls me down into defeat

21
00:02:57,860 --> 00:03:04,770
The cold door locks the world I came to mend

22
00:03:05,050 --> 00:03:11,810
Mara and Ginger vanish at the end

23
00:03:12,139 --> 00:03:18,169
The winter claims the boy beyond the pale

24
00:03:18,949 --> 00:03:26,849
Left dying in the dirt by a House for Sale

25
00:03:30,080 --> 00:03:32,580
Mara...

26
00:03:33,400 --> 00:03:35,900
Ginger...

27
00:03:37,169 --> 00:03:39,210
my god...

28
00:03:39,300 --> 00:03:41,800
I love you